Root cause:
The bug was caused by acquiring the `stats_lock` multiple times during the gathering of statistics, which allowed for a race condition where the statistics could be updated by another thread in between the lock acquisitions. This led to the potential for reporting out-of-sync counters. The patch resolves this by collecting all necessary statistics in advance and only acquiring the lock once to update the software structures, ensuring consistency in the reported statistics.
